<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We can make no assurances that required financing will be available for the amounts needed, or on terms commercially acceptable to us,
