    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Exemption
    from Section 16 rules regarding sales of Class A Ordinary Shares by insiders, which will provide less data in this regard
    than shareholders of U.S. companies that are subject to the Exchange Act.</span></td></tr>

<tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
