and US$<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20240401__20250331_zfRymCJ2Gdqb" title="Depreciation expenses"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2024-04-012025-03-31" id="Fact001400" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">149,290</ix:nonFraction></span>
respectively. In 2026, US$<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20250401__20260331__srt--ProductOrServiceAxis__custom--CostOfGoodsSoldMember_zs0QBAI3Dgye" title="Depreciation expenses"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2025-04-012026-03-31_custom_CostOfGoodsSoldMember" id="Fact001402" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">38,376</ix:nonFraction></span>
of the depreciation expense was attributed to the cost of goods sold, and US$<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20250401__20260331__srt--ProductOrServiceAxis__custom--GeneralAndAdministrativeExpensesMember_zkJsamNLsgba" title="Depreciation expenses"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2025-04-012026-03-31_custom_GeneralAndAdministrativeExpensesMember" id="Fact001404" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">92,109</ix:nonFraction></span>
was allocated to general and administrative expense. Depreciation expense for idle machinery increased in fiscal 2026 due to a
decrease in the number of projects. In 2025, US$<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20240401__20250331__srt--ProductOrServiceAxis__custom--CostOfGoodsSoldMember_z3xI4JoIbmU1" title="Depreciation expenses"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2024-04-012025-03-31_custom_CostOfGoodsSoldMember" id="Fact001406" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">133,772</ix:nonFraction></span>
of the depreciation expense was attributed to the cost of goods sold, and US$<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20240401__20250331__srt--ProductOrServiceAxis__custom--GeneralAndAdministrativeExpensesMember_z6PmP1NMx2ne" title="Depreciation expenses"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2024-04-012025-03-31_custom_GeneralAndAdministrativeExpensesMember" id="Fact001408" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">15,518</ix:nonFraction></span>
was allocated to general and administrative expense.</span></p>

